# Keep the image to: python + parklife/ + scripts/serve_api + webapp/ + data/parklife.db
# Everything below is dev/build/scrape state the runtime never reads.
.git
.venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc

# Large dev/scrape artifacts
data/raw
data/cache
data/seeds
data/export
data/parklife.db.bak*
data/parklife.db-wal
data/parklife.db-shm
data/.ebird_key

# The legacy single-blob demo (the new stack serves data from the DB, not this)
docs

# Repo docs / scripts not used by the API runtime
*.md
com.parklife.queue.plist
requirements.txt
tests
